        "text": "Muse is now in the UK: a personal AI agent that doesn't just answer questions, but one that you can task to get things done on your behalf The post Introducing Muse in the UK: A Personal AI Agent You Control appeared first on Meta Newsroom .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Introducing Muse in the UK: A Personal AI Agent You Control",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse is now in the UK: a personal AI agent that doesn’t just answer questions, but one that you can task to get things done on your behalf.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You’re in control: Muse asks before taking actions like sending an email or making a purchase on your behalf, can’t see your passwords or card details, and shows you everything it’s done.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse is available to anyone aged 18 and over in the UK on iOS, Android, muse.ai and WhatsApp.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "And from today, Meta’s personal AI agent, which proactively helps with your goals and suggests ideas, is available in the UK.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Chat to it wherever suits you – in the Muse app or in WhatsApp – it’s your Muse wherever you call on it, with the same memory of how you like things done.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "And to make Muse feel even more at home in the UK, we’re also working with UK connector partners such as Marks & Spencer, Debenhams Group, Currys, Ocado Retail, Trainline, Argos, Sainsbury’s, ASOS, Jet2, LOOKFANTASTIC, MyProtein, Cult Beauty, JustPark, easyJet and JD Sports.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Shruti Dube, UK Country Director at Meta: “I’m thrilled that millions of Brits will now have access to a personal agent that they control and that gets things done on their behalf.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "To get things done, you can connect Muse to the apps you already use, from your email and calendar to the websites you shop on.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We know that’s an act of trust, so you’re in control at every step: you decide which apps Muse connects to and what access it gets, you can see everything it’s done and plans to do next, and you can decide what it remembers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You also decide whether we can use your interactions with Muse to train and improve AI at Meta , and you can switch this off at any time in Settings.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Muse is available to anyone aged 18 and over in the UK from today on iOS, Android, muse.ai and WhatsApp, and is coming to Meta’s AI glasses in the months ahead.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://about.fb.com/news/2026/11/introducing-muse-in-the-uk-a-personal-ai-agent-you-control/",
        "source": "Meta Newsroom",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-24T06:00:40.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-24T20:39:30.891Z"
      }
    ],
